#~ "maintenance work for example.<br/><b>Name:</b> "
#~ "The name of the agent.<br/><b>Status:</b> "
#~ "The current state of the agent UP,"
#~ " DOWN or UNKNOWN.<br/><b>Alerts:</b> The "
#~ "number of current alerts triggered on"
#~ " the agent.<br/><b>Version:</b> The version "
#~ "number of the agent running on the"
#~ " host.<br/><b>Processes:</b> The number of "
#~ "processes running on the "
#~ "host.<br/><b>Threads:</b> The number of "
#~ "threads running on the host.<br/><b>CPU "
#~ "Utilization:</b> The average utilization of"
#~ " all CPU cores on the "
#~ "host.<br/><b>Memory Utilization:</b> The percentage"
#~ " of available RAM memory used on "
#~ "the host.<br/><b>Swap Utilization:</b> The "
#~ "percentage of available swap memory used"
#~ " on the host.<br/><b>Disk Utilization:</b> "
#~ "The percentage of total disk space "
#~ "used, for all disks on the "
