#~ "alert.The caret-right icon in the "
#~ "table grid will expand to display "
#~ "detailed information and parameters of "
#~ "that alert when clicked.<br/><br/><b>Alarm "
#~ "Type:</b> The alert severity.<br/><b>Object "
#~ "Description:</b> The description of the "
